      "problem": "Evaluate $Γ(3).$",
      "worked_solution": "For any natural number $n\\ge 1,$ we have\n\n$$\nΓ(n)=(n-1)!.\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nΓ(3)=2!=2.\n$$",
